WEBVTT

00:04.710 --> 00:09.300
This story is a work of fiction.
The names of characters, places, organizations, etc., mentioned in this story are fictitious and have no relation to any real person or entity.

00:19.900 --> 00:21.210
I'm here.

01:59.050 --> 02:04.040
Deer Meets Dark Girl

02:10.460 --> 02:11.940
Let me introduce her again.

02:12.250 --> 02:14.120
Her name is Koshi Torako.

02:14.630 --> 02:16.310
She used to be a delinquent.

02:17.040 --> 02:19.210
She hid that when she debuted in high school,

02:19.410 --> 02:21.510
built up her status as an honor student,

02:21.760 --> 02:26.390
and now serves as the student council president and class representative.

02:26.710 --> 02:29.210
But she was found out by a transferred deer,

02:29.250 --> 02:31.420
Shikanoko Noko,

02:31.620 --> 02:33.560
who also revealed she’s a virgin.

02:33.680 --> 02:36.900
Despite that, because she’s very naive,

02:36.030 --> 02:36.740
Deer Club. Seeking New Members!

02:36.980 --> 02:39.480
she ended up as the head of the Deer club,

02:39.750 --> 02:42.760
So, today too, she reluctantly goes to the club.

02:43.100 --> 02:45.050
Well, it's club time.

02:46.010 --> 02:47.550
It doesn't seem so reluctant.

02:48.090 --> 02:51.620
No, it’s not like I’m looking forward to the club.

02:52.340 --> 02:53.170
Then why?

02:53.630 --> 02:57.010
When I tried rearranging the clubroom in the morning,

02:57.320 --> 02:59.730
it turned out really nice,

02:59.980 --> 03:04.170
so I’m really looking forward to today’s club meeting,

03:04.560 --> 03:07.360
but that’s definitely not the reason.

03:07.610 --> 03:08.740
Is that so?

03:09.070 --> 03:12.600
Well, making the clubroom comfortable is the duty of the president,

03:12.870 --> 03:14.780
I'm looking forward to her reaction!

03:15.390 --> 03:16.510
Koshi-tan, you’re amazing!

03:16.600 --> 03:17.830
I’m impressed!

03:18.010 --> 03:19.120
Of course!

03:19.650 --> 03:23.460
Now to put up the wallpaper, and place a shelf too!

03:23.720 --> 03:26.000
There's still a lot to do!

03:26.310 --> 03:29.490
Wait for me, my utopia!

03:36.870 --> 03:38.330
Deers are not allowed.

03:41.310 --> 03:43.270
Announcement of the end of Utopia.

03:43.410 --> 03:44.610
Deers are not allowed.

03:46.490 --> 03:48.320
Kumagoro!

03:48.780 --> 03:52.600
W-what’s going on, my utopia!

03:52.870 --> 03:58.710
The utopia I spent all my money and four hours this morning to create!

03:59.440 --> 04:01.160
She woke up at 3 am.

04:01.690 --> 04:03.290
Are you okay, Koshi-tan?

04:04.870 --> 04:07.930
It's dangerous if you stay there. Come here.

04:07.960 --> 04:09.040
It was you!

04:09.060 --> 04:10.200
It was definitely you!

04:10.470 --> 04:13.930
Who else did this to my utopia?

04:14.060 --> 04:15.470
W-what are you talking about?

04:15.980 --> 04:19.560
The room was already like this when I came.

04:20.990 --> 04:22.780
Also, this room is dangerous.

04:23.710 --> 04:24.730
What do you mean?

04:25.040 --> 04:28.180
I think someone’s trying to kill me today.

04:28.400 --> 04:30.040
But who? Why?

04:30.310 --> 04:31.100
I don't know.

04:31.550 --> 04:34.690
But I think the room’s state is also their doing.

04:35.390 --> 04:37.850
I fell into a 5-meter hole on my way to school,

04:38.350 --> 04:39.870
a spears fell from the sky,

04:40.510 --> 04:42.740
there was even a water-filled bottles.

04:43.610 --> 04:44.820
How are you still alive?

04:44.880 --> 04:46.610
Wasn't the spear stuck in your head?

04:46.770 --> 04:51.140
And even cats wouldn't be afraid of a water bottles these days!

04:51.290 --> 04:53.960
Also, my antlers got stuck in the door!

04:54.310 --> 04:56.320
Did you break it again?

04:56.490 --> 04:58.590
Anyway, this place is dangerous!

04:58.790 --> 04:59.810
Calm down!

05:00.270 --> 05:03.150
There's no one who would target you. Think logically.

05:03.310 --> 05:04.320
Really?

05:04.550 --> 05:05.260
That's right!

05:05.510 --> 05:10.340
At times like this, you should get some fresh air and think calmly!

05:13.000 --> 05:16.010
Hey! How could you stick your head out so carelessly?

05:16.340 --> 05:17.560
This is a battlefield!

05:17.660 --> 05:18.230
Who are you?

05:18.430 --> 05:21.560
You know, a slight carelessness can be deadly on the battlefield!

05:21.830 --> 05:23.090
I didn't learn that!

05:23.300 --> 05:25.100
I'm from the peaceful Heisei era!

05:25.480 --> 05:28.050
Are you seriously being targeted?

05:28.340 --> 05:29.350
Seems like it…

05:29.990 --> 05:31.630
Ugh, I can't stay here!

05:32.820 --> 05:35.570
Are you abandoning your instructor and running away?

05:35.660 --> 05:38.650
Shut up! I never agreed to be your pupil!

05:39.150 --> 05:41.620
I don’t want to get involved in more trouble…

05:44.990 --> 05:46.940
Koshi-tan, is your head okay?

05:47.140 --> 05:48.240
Not an insult.

05:49.050 --> 05:50.620
Who could it be?

05:50.860 --> 05:54.350
Give me back my utopia!

05:54.480 --> 05:56.060
Completely lost it.

05:56.310 --> 05:57.900
Let’s do this!

05:58.380 --> 06:03.950
Whether a soldier or an assassin… come at me!

06:18.970 --> 06:20.820
Oh no, a grenade!

06:23.900 --> 06:25.240
A deer cracker?

06:26.220 --> 06:27.450
Hey, that's a trap!

06:30.110 --> 06:32.750
Idiot, idiot, idiot, wait, wait, wait!

06:33.360 --> 06:34.520
What, Koshi-tan?

06:34.760 --> 06:36.380
No, it's obviously a trap!

06:36.440 --> 06:37.740
A trap of traps!

06:38.390 --> 06:41.600
Who drools and charges into a trap?

06:42.380 --> 06:42.950
A trap…

06:43.210 --> 06:44.010
Shikanoko?

06:45.130 --> 06:48.070
Long ago, a certain deer was asked.

06:48.360 --> 06:50.960
Why do deer eat deer crackers?

06:51.780 --> 06:53.240
It supposedly answered,

06:54.300 --> 06:56.440
Because there are deer crackers there!

07:07.670 --> 07:09.500
Shikanoko!

07:09.900 --> 07:10.960
Sorry, Koshi-tan.

07:11.570 --> 07:15.100
But I love deer crackers more than anything.

07:27.980 --> 07:28.940
I was careless.

07:29.440 --> 07:31.230
That's why I said it was a trap.

07:31.250 --> 07:35.690
In the end, I couldn’t reach the deer crackers because my speed dropped!

07:35.720 --> 07:36.610
That’s the issue?

07:39.410 --> 07:39.770
Hey!

07:40.080 --> 07:42.900
The one who’s been targeting me, I know you can hear!

07:43.170 --> 07:44.440
My name is Nokotan!

07:44.570 --> 07:46.130
If you have business with me, come out!

07:46.770 --> 07:49.410
I'll take you down right now!

07:49.670 --> 07:51.560
Aren’t you already defeated?

07:51.770 --> 07:53.480
Head of the defeated deer.

07:53.890 --> 07:56.150
And, more deer crackers please!

07:56.290 --> 07:58.310
Who do you think you are?

07:58.630 --> 08:00.780
You're quite a bold pest.

08:01.850 --> 08:06.550
I intended to eliminate you much earlier, but my calculations were completely off.

08:07.050 --> 08:09.540
I accept the challenge.

08:10.090 --> 08:12.320
I’ll send you to hell.

08:13.080 --> 08:13.850
This one.

08:14.290 --> 08:17.290
To capture me, who has survived countless battles, so easily.

08:17.490 --> 08:20.560
You’re not ordinary.

08:20.880 --> 08:22.330
Who are you?

08:22.550 --> 08:23.290
Anko?

08:23.350 --> 08:24.090
Anko?

08:24.400 --> 08:26.790
What are you doing?

08:29.150 --> 08:30.580
Sister!

08:31.370 --> 08:32.640
I missed you!

08:33.010 --> 08:35.840
Missed me? You see me at home all the time.

08:36.050 --> 08:40.880
I want to be with you 24 hours a day, 365 days a year.

08:42.250 --> 08:44.670
Your smell is irresistible.

08:44.780 --> 08:46.340
Hey, stop it.

08:46.580 --> 08:48.840
More importantly, what’s with your outfit?

08:49.210 --> 08:51.400
Your face is also cute.

08:51.710 --> 08:53.030
Are you listening?

08:53.470 --> 08:54.970
Koshi-tan, who is she?

08:55.200 --> 08:56.200
Oh, sorry.

08:56.750 --> 08:58.040
This is Koshi Anko.

08:58.340 --> 08:59.600
My little sister.

08:59.930 --> 09:01.430
Koshi Anko.

09:02.010 --> 09:03.480
Koshi An…

09:04.800 --> 09:08.430
I bet you’re imagining something delicious.

09:09.490 --> 09:12.400
No, you're going to die! Don't stare at me, you monster!

09:14.020 --> 09:15.220
Shikanoko Noko.

09:15.540 --> 09:17.300
I won’t forgive you.

09:17.710 --> 09:19.760
Why do you hate Shikanoko?

09:19.910 --> 09:23.480
Ah, could it be, you’re behind all this?

09:23.820 --> 09:24.540
That’s right.

09:24.840 --> 09:26.090
I did it.

09:26.280 --> 09:27.570
Why would you do such a thing?

09:27.820 --> 09:31.150
It’s all because of that deer!

09:31.590 --> 09:34.390
Because of the deer, my sister has changed.

09:34.970 --> 09:39.400
You always came back to me right after school.

09:39.580 --> 09:42.410
By “back to me” you mean our family home?

09:42.550 --> 09:44.880
Lately, You've been coming home late every day.

09:44.900 --> 09:46.940
I’m back by 7pm.

09:47.010 --> 09:49.100
I wondered what you was doing so late,

09:49.120 --> 09:50.450
so I followed a bit to a closet room

09:50.650 --> 09:53.250
where you taking care of the deer under the pretext of club activities.

09:53.330 --> 09:54.450
How indecent.

09:54.580 --> 09:57.040
Indecency is in your mind!

09:57.530 --> 10:01.260
And today, you left the house early in the morning,

10:01.460 --> 10:04.070
and was engrossed in making a love nest with the deer.

10:04.490 --> 10:06.310
Are those essential sofas

10:06.340 --> 10:09.590
and cute rugs necessary in the clubroom?

10:09.610 --> 10:10.680
Indecent!

10:10.790 --> 10:13.100
Are you planning something scandalous here?

10:13.180 --> 10:14.300
W-well.

10:14.760 --> 10:17.710
She wanted to deny it, but she couldn't say it was for selfish reasons.

10:18.000 --> 10:20.050
You can’t answer, so maybe!

10:22.010 --> 10:23.280
Have you already slept together?

10:23.390 --> 10:24.480
Of course not!

10:24.650 --> 10:26.070
Are you my jealous girlfriend or what?

10:26.310 --> 10:27.610
And why the kunai?

10:27.790 --> 10:29.070
Are you from Iga? Kouga?

10:29.190 --> 10:30.070
Are you Hokage?

10:30.510 --> 10:33.180
Hey, you tell Anko too.

10:33.770 --> 10:35.590
Koshi-tan is my woman!

10:35.710 --> 10:37.090
Why did it come to this!

10:37.210 --> 10:38.950
Why are you going along with it?

10:39.160 --> 10:41.270
That's not what this is about!

10:41.410 --> 10:44.700
I don't care if it's rough or fine, I will protect Koshi-tan!

10:44.760 --> 10:47.270
Idiot! You only going to rile her up!

10:47.520 --> 10:50.440
You really took my sister’s virginity!

10:50.670 --> 10:52.530
See, this is what happens!

10:52.970 --> 10:57.390
Who do you think has been protecting my sister’s virginity all this time?

10:57.410 --> 10:59.630
I don’t remember being protected by anyone!

10:59.940 --> 11:01.160
Unforgivable.

11:01.450 --> 11:03.980
Both the deer who took my sister from me,

11:04.160 --> 11:06.190
and my sister who crossed the line with the deer.

11:06.200 --> 11:09.040
Stage: Hino City

11:06.590 --> 11:09.060
Neither line nor the Chuo Main Line was crossed!

11:09.550 --> 11:12.260
My place is next to my sister.

11:12.470 --> 11:15.010
Anyone who gets in the way is my enemy.

11:15.430 --> 11:18.620
So I thought I’d destroy everything.

11:18.700 --> 11:19.810
Anko?

11:20.300 --> 11:23.460
I thought I’d wreck this foolish Deer Club,

11:23.480 --> 11:28.300
and eliminate the pest, so my sister would return to me.

11:28.480 --> 11:30.840
But I’ve changed my mind.

11:31.760 --> 11:32.650
Nyan!

11:32.970 --> 11:36.120
You said we’d have a fair fight.

11:36.230 --> 11:37.480
That’s interesting.

11:37.590 --> 11:39.770
I’ll accept.

11:39.950 --> 11:46.430
But if I win, you’ll live the rest of your life as a deer in Nara Park.

11:46.810 --> 11:47.530
Nara.

11:47.930 --> 11:49.790
Of course, if I lose,

11:50.030 --> 11:54.450
I will acknowledge your indecent relationship with my sister and gracefully withdraw.

11:54.510 --> 11:56.460
Stop saying things that cause misunderstandings!

11:56.810 --> 11:58.860
Anko, enough already.

11:59.240 --> 12:00.330
This is ridiculous.

12:00.870 --> 12:02.870
There’s no point in fighting in the first place.

12:03.350 --> 12:06.760
Why? That deer was the one who challenged me.

12:07.350 --> 12:09.420
Well, that’s true.

12:10.130 --> 12:11.940
Fine. Let’s fight.

12:13.620 --> 12:15.430
Wait a minute. Are you serious?

12:15.910 --> 12:19.880
What will happen to the Deer Club if you become a deer in Nara Park?

12:20.310 --> 12:21.640
It’s okay, Koshi-tan.

12:23.330 --> 12:24.660
Believe in me!

12:25.440 --> 12:29.710
Our Deer Club is bonded by a stronger connection than deer crackers!

12:29.870 --> 12:31.090
Shikanoko…

12:32.170 --> 12:34.020
I don’t get it, but okay!

12:34.120 --> 12:36.890
Deer crackers aren’t even hard! They’re crispy!

12:37.160 --> 12:39.410
But I have one condition too.

12:39.650 --> 12:40.400
What?

12:40.670 --> 12:43.070
If I win this fight,

12:46.830 --> 12:48.760
I want lots of deer crackers.

12:48.780 --> 12:50.000
Just go to Nara!

12:50.150 --> 12:52.660
The first major crisis since the Deer Club was founded.

12:53.050 --> 12:55.300
What will happen to the Deer Club? What will happen to Nokotan?

12:55.660 --> 12:59.800
The death match for the fate of deer crackers and the Deer Club begins now!

13:00.130 --> 13:03.230
I’ll send you straight to Nara Park.

13:03.550 --> 13:05.600
All-you-can-eat deer crackers.

13:06.320 --> 13:08.280
Can I go home?

13:15.540 --> 13:22.730
Hinominami High School Koshi Torako Championship is about to begin

13:16.670 --> 13:20.550
1st Hinominami High School
Koshi Torako Championship

13:22.170 --> 13:22.920
1st Hinominami High School
Koshi Torako Championship

13:23.240 --> 13:25.830
First, let’s introduce the two contestants.

13:25.880 --> 13:27.190
What’s going on?!

13:27.750 --> 13:32.540
Koshi Torako’s sister, the extremely sis-con Koshi Anko-chan.

13:32.920 --> 13:36.420
Is there any meaning to this world if my sister and I are not together?

13:36.540 --> 13:38.050
Hey, what is this?

13:38.140 --> 13:41.130
Deer Club member, Shikanoko Nokotan.

13:41.200 --> 13:43.240
I will do my best for deer crackers.

13:43.430 --> 13:45.080
Can you hear me?

13:45.130 --> 13:49.340
Koshi-san, you so pressured by these two. How do you feel?

13:49.440 --> 13:51.370
I don’t understand.

13:51.570 --> 13:53.550
So you’re very excited.

13:53.750 --> 13:55.710
Can you hear my voice?

13:56.130 --> 13:58.640
The prize for the winner is…

13:58.860 --> 14:03.090
Anko-chan gets the right to deport Nokotan to Nara Park.

14:03.320 --> 14:06.240
Nokotan gets 100 years’ worth of deer crackers.

14:06.500 --> 14:08.390
How did you even prepare these?

14:08.870 --> 14:13.880
The host will be the Deer Club advisor, Ukai.

14:13.950 --> 14:15.660
Are teachers that free?

14:15.980 --> 14:18.140
Well then, let’s get started!

14:18.250 --> 14:20.760
Isn’t this set a bit too elaborate?

14:20.960 --> 14:23.300
First question. What does Koshi-san do every night…

14:24.480 --> 14:27.600
…before he goes to sleep?

14:28.230 --> 14:33.140
The answer is, she talks to her stuffed animals in her room, kissing them goodnight.

14:33.460 --> 14:34.170
Correct!

14:34.270 --> 14:36.700
Stop it! What kind of question is this!

14:36.900 --> 14:39.310
Why are you exposing my privacy?

14:39.590 --> 14:40.510
Is it not okay?

14:40.680 --> 14:42.430
Of course it’s not okay!

14:42.590 --> 14:45.770
But Koshi-tan’s popularity is increasing, isn’t that good?

14:46.070 --> 14:48.180
Koshi-san likes stuffed animals?

14:48.430 --> 14:49.450
Cute.

14:49.510 --> 14:50.270
I support this!

14:50.360 --> 14:52.470
That’s not the issue here!

14:52.640 --> 14:55.150
By the way, here’s the proof photo.

14:57.570 --> 15:01.980
Privacy! Privacy! Stop it with these questions!

15:02.410 --> 15:03.710
Next, the second question.

15:03.820 --> 15:04.720
You ignore me?

15:05.300 --> 15:06.700
Is Koshi-san…

15:08.170 --> 15:11.740
Oh, this time Nokotan is quick. Your answer?

15:12.050 --> 15:13.980
Is Koshi-tan braless right now?

15:14.400 --> 15:17.650
The correct answer is that she is wearing a bra top, so it can be considered topless.

15:17.820 --> 15:19.650
What kind of question is that?!

15:24.320 --> 15:25.310
Correct!

15:25.520 --> 15:28.270
You can’t know without seeing!

15:28.440 --> 15:29.890
Schrödinger's bra.

15:30.210 --> 15:32.360
Then, here’s the proof video!

15:35.960 --> 15:37.650
Stop it, stop it, stop it!

15:37.760 --> 15:41.340
Why do you have such footage!

15:41.370 --> 15:42.380
Question three

15:42.470 --> 15:43.970
Can I just go home now?

15:44.500 --> 15:46.450
How many Koshi-san…

15:47.070 --> 15:51.280
How many boys or girls has Koshi-tan dated so far?

15:51.630 --> 15:53.010
The correct answer is zero!

15:53.250 --> 15:55.430
No, there was at least one!

15:55.530 --> 15:56.320
There isn’t.

15:58.090 --> 15:59.780
Sorry, incorrect.

16:00.640 --> 16:05.880
Koshi-san has dated zero boys or girls so far,

16:06.160 --> 16:07.860
but why?

16:08.210 --> 16:10.640
Explain in 30 words or less.

16:10.780 --> 16:13.400
Is there a need to delve into this?

16:14.960 --> 16:17.330
Yes, Anko-chan, your answer!

16:18.320 --> 16:22.010
While those around her deepened their relationships with close friends,

16:22.230 --> 16:24.630
she never experienced first love even in high school,

16:24.870 --> 16:29.260
believing that her destined person would appear, like in girls' manga.

16:29.590 --> 16:30.950
Exactly 30 words.

16:32.920 --> 16:33.740
Correct!

16:33.800 --> 16:35.670
Stop revealing personal details.

16:35.830 --> 16:37.950
Her favorite book is Bessatsu Friend.

16:38.600 --> 16:39.670
Fourth question.

16:40.310 --> 16:43.900
A secret childhood episode of Koshi-san?

16:44.130 --> 16:46.660
She wet the bed until she was 10 years old.

16:46.960 --> 16:47.520
Correct!

16:47.600 --> 16:48.740
Don’t say it!

16:49.140 --> 16:51.310
What Koshi-san actually likes?

16:51.880 --> 16:53.120
Children’s anime.

16:53.550 --> 16:54.090
Correct!

16:54.220 --> 16:56.880
What do you mean “actually”? There’s nothing wrong with it!

16:57.300 --> 16:59.260
Fifth question. Koshi-san's…

16:59.340 --> 17:00.730
Egg over rice.

17:00.950 --> 17:01.550
Correct!

17:01.790 --> 17:04.200
Isn’t it strange that you know from just that?

17:09.990 --> 17:11.490
What a surprise!

17:11.720 --> 17:14.500
So far, both are tied, not giving an inch!

17:14.620 --> 17:15.990
Go! Go!

17:16.070 --> 17:19.150
How much of my privacy are you going to expose…

17:21.190 --> 17:23.080
This is definitely wrong!

17:23.380 --> 17:26.460
How does this deer have so much information about my sister?

17:26.690 --> 17:28.800
There must be something behind this!

17:29.120 --> 17:32.470
I know! They must have collected data of my sister

17:32.610 --> 17:36.540
using deers from all over the country and analyzed it with a supercomputer,

17:36.820 --> 17:41.680
and received the data through her antlers!

17:42.020 --> 17:44.450
It has come to this, so I will use force!

17:49.430 --> 17:53.030
You were caught off guard! There are still traps left!

17:53.340 --> 17:55.960
Doesn't this make the quiz pointless in the end?

17:56.260 --> 17:59.380
It was just Koshi-tan’s private life being exposed.

17:59.880 --> 18:03.410
I'll skewer you before I send you to Nara Park!

18:07.980 --> 18:09.670
You dodged it!

18:10.080 --> 18:11.390
What’s with this deer?

18:11.630 --> 18:15.690
You better get hit! Take this! Take this! Take this!

18:16.050 --> 18:16.940
I’m tired.

18:17.390 --> 18:20.280
Should I take advantage and go home?

18:20.570 --> 18:21.870
This monster!

18:24.800 --> 18:25.850
Sister!

18:40.200 --> 18:41.400
Shikanoko!

18:41.640 --> 18:43.280
Hey! Shikanoko!

18:45.290 --> 18:49.740
Koshi-tan, I’m feeling very sleepy.

18:49.870 --> 18:53.250
What are you saying! Pull yourself together! Shikanoko!

18:53.560 --> 18:55.120
Open your eyes! Shikanoko!

18:55.560 --> 18:56.950
Shikanoko!

18:59.370 --> 19:00.270
Why?

19:00.400 --> 19:01.560
You stuck around without permission,

19:02.200 --> 19:03.760
created a club without permission,

19:04.170 --> 19:06.690
dragged people in without permission,

19:07.220 --> 19:12.860
and now you’re disappearing from in front of me without permission!

20:09.790 --> 20:11.620
Shikanoko, you alive!

20:15.080 --> 20:17.300
I-it’s good you’re alive, but

20:17.610 --> 20:19.980
what happened, exactly?

20:22.970 --> 20:24.240
At that time…

20:30.830 --> 20:33.420
It seems the deer cracker I picked up saved me.

20:33.790 --> 20:35.200
Like an old movie!

20:35.390 --> 20:38.580
Deer crackers aren’t even hard! They’re crispy!

20:39.860 --> 20:40.860
Shikanoko.

20:42.720 --> 20:44.600
Thank you for saving my sister.

20:45.650 --> 20:46.820
A toast to you.

20:48.230 --> 20:53.220
I was so consumed with hatred and anger that I almost hurt my sister.

20:53.860 --> 20:55.940
I’m a failure as a sister like this!

20:56.200 --> 20:58.880
You are the one who deserves to be by my sister’s side.

20:58.910 --> 20:59.850
That’s not true!

21:01.310 --> 21:02.540
That’s not true!

21:03.170 --> 21:09.640
Thanks to the deer cracker you, no, Koshian gave me, I was able to protect Koshi-tan.

21:10.220 --> 21:12.120
Koshian, you’re a lifesaver!

21:13.370 --> 21:16.090
It looks like we could become good friends, don’t you think?

21:18.710 --> 21:21.010
Can I call you Nokotan?

21:23.290 --> 21:24.130
Of course!

21:25.660 --> 21:28.900
Please continue to take care of my sister, Nokotan!

21:29.190 --> 21:30.740
Leave it to me, Koshian!

21:39.870 --> 21:44.320
Nokotan! Koshian! Nokotan! Koshian!

21:44.530 --> 21:46.860
You can do it, both of you!

21:47.660 --> 21:53.340
In the end, Koshi-tan never managed to follow the developments from start to finish.

21:54.150 --> 21:59.120
Anyway, from tomorrow, I’ll always be on guard.

22:02.320 --> 22:03.590
Today is white.

22:03.650 --> 22:04.490
Seeing through?
